{"id":"n56544-2-7","stage":3,"title":"받침 · 收音","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56544-2-7-1","ko":"‘이’와 ‘김’이라는 글자 중 받침이 있는 글자는 어떤 것인가요?","zh":"‘이’和‘김’这两个字里，哪个字有收音呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"‘이’와","meaning":"韩文音节 이，与……","explanation":"这里谈论韩文字形 이，不是李姓；와 连接并列项，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"이’와","audio":"/audio/19d0cbb9b19cb6436d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이’와","audio":"/audio/19d0cbb9b19cb6436d2b.mp3"}},{"text":"‘김’이라는","meaning":"叫作 김 的（音节）","explanation":"这里谈论韩文音节 김；이라는 引用这个名称，修饰后面的 글자（字）。","readings":[{"term":"김’이라는","audio":"/audio/2b2afb74026f8cb6a117.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김’이라는","audio":"/audio/2b2afb74026f8cb6a117.mp3"}},{"text":"글자","meaning":"字，文字","explanation":"글자：字，文字","readings":[{"term":"글자","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62490","senseId":"1","lemma":"글자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글자","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3"}},{"text":"중","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}},{"text":"받침이","meaning":"收音","explanation":"받침：收音；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"받침","audio":"/audio/414debf5ce69c3bdcab7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56544","senseId":"2","lemma":"받침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받침이","audio":"/audio/054150d346543dc9081f.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"글자는","meaning":"字，文字","explanation":"글자：字，文字；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"글자","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62490","senseId":"1","lemma":"글자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글자는","audio":"/audio/575f0c9600211a4c514a.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"것인가요?","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것인가요","audio":"/audio/f80ee5188a4527e65f95.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"068c2631228200cf","term":"글자","zh":"字，文字","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3","entryId":"62490","definition":"记录语言的符号。","pronunciation":["글짜"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"414debf5ce69c3bd","term":"받침","zh":"收音","audio":"/audio/414debf5ce69c3bdcab7.mp3","entryId":"56544","definition":"表示写韩文时，在一个音节的元音后，写在其下面的子音。","pronunciation":["받침"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/20dfea82968ff14af59a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56544-2-7-2","ko":"‘김’이라는 글자에 ‘ㅁ’ 받침이 있습니다.","zh":